         'svc.dental-advisory.step3': 'Speak to the dentist at your booked time.',
         'svc.dental-advisory.step4': 'You receive a clear recommendation and a rough cost.',
         'svc.dental-advisory.step5': 'If treatment is needed, we book it there and then.',
         'svc.dental-advisory.aftercare': 'You will get a short written summary of the advice you were given, so you are not relying on memory. If we recommended coming in, the summary includes what the appointment will cover. Remote advice has limits — a dentist cannot diagnose everything through a screen, and we will say so plainly when an examination is the only way to be sure.',
         'svc.dental-advisory.fact1.label': 'Consultation length',
