         'svc.dental-advisory.fact4.label': 'Follow-up',
         'svc.dental-advisory.fact4.value': 'Written summary included',

         'svc.dental-implants.intro': 'An implant is a titanium root placed into the jawbone, with a crown fixed on top. Unlike a bridge, it does not rely on the teeth beside it, and unlike a denture it does not move. It is the closest thing to getting your own tooth back.',
         'svc.dental-implants.involves': 'We first check that there is enough healthy bone to hold the implant, using a scan. The implant is then placed under local anaesthetic in a procedure most patients find easier than they expected. Over the next few months the bone grows onto the titanium and locks it in place. Once it is stable, we take an impression and fit the final crown.',
         'svc.dental-implants.inc1': 'A scan to assess bone volume and plan the position',
         'svc.dental-implants.inc2': 'Placement of the titanium implant under local anaesthetic',
         'svc.dental-implants.inc3': 'A temporary tooth while the implant integrates',
         'svc.dental-implants.inc4': 'A custom-made crown matched to your other teeth',
