         'svc.oral-hygiene.intro': 'Brushing at home cannot remove hardened plaque, and it is that build-up along the gum line that causes bleeding gums, bad breath and eventually loose teeth. A professional clean twice a year is the cheapest dentistry you will ever pay for.',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.involves': 'Your hygienist checks the health of your gums and measures the pockets around each tooth. Ultrasonic scaling then breaks up the hardened tartar above and below the gum line, and polishing removes surface stain and leaves the enamel smooth so plaque takes longer to settle again. If your gums are inflamed we plan a deeper clean over more than one visit.',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.inc1': 'A gum health assessment with pocket measurements',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.inc2': 'Ultrasonic scaling above and below the gum line',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.inc3': 'Stain removal and polishing',
