         'svc.oral-hygiene.step2': 'Hardened tartar is broken up and removed with an ultrasonic scaler.',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.step3': 'Remaining deposits are cleared by hand around the gum line.',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.step4': 'Teeth are polished and treated with fluoride.',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.step5': 'We show you the technique that will keep the problem areas clean.',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.aftercare': 'Your gums may feel tender and bleed slightly for a day or two — that is normal and it settles. Some people notice mild sensitivity to cold for about a week. Keep brushing gently twice a day, clean between your teeth daily, and book your next clean before you leave so it does not get forgotten.',
         'svc.oral-hygiene.fact1.label': 'Appointment length',
